Emojinq cartographic alphabet
=============================

The cartographic alphanumeric geometry is original Castalia Institute artwork.
Its canonical, reproducible source is scripts/cartographic_alphabet.py and the
generated stroke-only SVG corpus under assets/alpha-ink/.

No third-party font outlines are incorporated into this alphabet. Visual
references informed the general category—historic Roman and uncial map
lettering—but not the glyph paths.
